member/syh2\">syh2</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 22:37:19 +08:00\">16h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Leeeeex\">Leeeeex</a> #10  请教一下 cloudflare 在哪里充值，找了一圈没找到</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942342\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7761/b868/553614_normal.png?m=1761704153\" alt=\"syh2\" data-uid=\"553614\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/syh2\">syh2</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 22:37:44 +08:00\">16h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/zhhmax\">zhhmax</a> #1 收到，我试试注册您的中转站，谢谢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942437\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b33b/7360/96264_normal.png?m=1769997070\" alt=\"singer\" data-uid=\"96264\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/singer\">singer</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 23:45:17 +08:00\">15h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>官方 API 充值没有限制，我充值用的是币安+SAVO 。<br>币安买币，充值到 SAVO ，用美元支付。</p><p>充值有税，你看看你能不能弄到免税州区，其他很简单。</p><p>![<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/i/viZdFuB1.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" title=\"在新窗口打开图片 viZdFuB1.png\"><img src=\"//i.v2ex.co/viZdFuB1.png\"></a>]( <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/i/viZdFuB1.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" title=\"在新窗口打开图片 viZdFuB1.png\